<title>USA: Noranda cuts US aluminum price by 3 cents.</title>
<headline>Noranda cuts US aluminum price by 3 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noranda Aluminum Inc said its July ingot price will be 80.00 cents a lb, down 3 cents from June.</p>
<p>Noranda cut its billet price by the same amount to 90.00 cents.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
